      ],
      "text": "Social/Emotional:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " moves away from you but looks to make sure you are close by · points to show you something interesting · puts hands out for you to wash them · looks @ a few pages in a book w you · helps you dress him (pushing arm thru a sleeve · lifting a foot) - "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Language/Communication:"
