      "text": " (ex, \"Give it to me\") - "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Cog:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " copies you doing chores (sweeping) · plays w toys in a simple way (pushing a toy car) - "
